Q.Implement a program to calculate the Simple Interest by using the formula given below and display the calculated Simple Interest.

Simple Interest = (principal*rate of interest*time)/100 
Ans:
class Tester {
	public static void main(String[] args) {
	    int rate=10;
	    int t=5;
	    int p=5000;
		float si=((p*rate*t)/100 );
		System.out.println(si);
	}
}


